{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01019",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 5.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.55,
      "end_seconds": 11.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.07,
      "end_seconds": 19.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Let me think, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.86,
      "end_seconds": 25.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 27.48,
      "end_seconds": 30.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "So, we came because of tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.21,
      "end_seconds": 34.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Has there been recurrent thrush too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.0,
      "end_seconds": 53.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "yes, actually and tingling in my toes as well, um, since last Tuesday um, about tingling in my toes, it's moderate, honestly. Night definitely sets it off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.03,
      "end_seconds": 57.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.44,
      "end_seconds": 73.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.08,
      "end_seconds": 90.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "okay: saturation 96 percent, pulse 88, pressure 152 over 104."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.41,
      "end_seconds": 94.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.51,
      "end_seconds": 99.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "they help me see the whole picture, more shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.67,
      "end_seconds": 106.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.96,
      "end_seconds": 109.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.71,
      "end_seconds": 127.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "The feeling at the tips of your toes is reduced and the foot pulses are present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.23,
      "end_seconds": 137.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "You can sit up now. And what about vomiting, chest pain or foot ulcers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.32,
      "end_seconds": 141.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "nope, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.27,
      "end_seconds": 144.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.45,
      "end_seconds": 147.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.99,
      "end_seconds": 150.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.94,
      "end_seconds": 155.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "hmm, no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.87,
      "end_seconds": 160.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Alright, have you been to to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.79,
      "end_seconds": 168.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "yeah, just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.63,
      "end_seconds": 174.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "so, do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.66,
      "end_seconds": 179.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.65,
      "end_seconds": 183.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.67,
      "end_seconds": 192.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.04,
      "end_seconds": 194.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.7,
      "end_seconds": 198.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.74,
      "end_seconds": 202.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "right, tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.82,
      "end_seconds": 211.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.21,
      "end_seconds": 227.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 228.73,
      "end_seconds": 233.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "He takes Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.76,
      "end_seconds": 236.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "when did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 238.45,
      "end_seconds": 239.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "About two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.35,
      "end_seconds": 260.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.79,
      "end_seconds": 265.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.45,
      "end_seconds": 288.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Right, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.46,
      "end_seconds": 293.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.16,
      "end_seconds": 328.17,
      "duration_seconds": 33.01,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like diabetes not well controlled on current treatment. I think an HbA1c makes sense here, for diabetes review. For this, gliclazide, 40 milligrams, once a day with breakfast, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for diabetes. Check your feet daily and book the eye screening. Let's get you seen by the diabetes educator, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.25,
      "end_seconds": 337.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.32,
      "end_seconds": 343.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Uh, I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.53,
      "end_seconds": 347.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.31,
      "end_seconds": 351.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.93,
      "end_seconds": 356.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.37,
      "end_seconds": 361.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Um, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}